      "search:sku": "007V-06360",
      "search:title": "rSARS-CoV-2_∆E67a3*_XBB.1.5",
      "search:description": "Recombinant chimeric SARS-CoV-2 with XBB.1.5 spike. ∆E-based vaccine virus, needs to be propagated on E-transcomplementing cells (Ref-SKU: 007S-06365). Virus was obtained as described in doi: 10.64898/2026.03.09.709481 .",
