      "search:description": "Recombinant chimeric SARS-CoV-2, expresses VSV-G. ∆E-based vaccine virus, needs to be propagated on E-transcomplementing cells (Ref-SKU: 007S-06365). Virus was produced using the CLEVER method as described in (doi: 10.7554/eLife.89035).",
