      "search:title": "pUC19_CoV-2_ frD_∆orf3a∆E/VSVG ∆orf6 ∆orf7a",
      "search:description": "Template for chimeric SARS-CoV-2 rescue; encodes fragment D of SARS-CoV-2 (nt20950-29867), with deletion of E, orf6, orf7a, orf3a. The VSV-G gene is introduced instead of orf3a/E. ∆E-based viruses need to be rescued and propagated on E-transcomplementing cells. Full protocol for virus recovery using the CLEVER method in (10.7554/eLife.89035).",
