      "search:description": "Template for recombinant SARS-CoV-2 rescue; encodes fragment D of SARS-CoV-2 (nt20950-29867), C-terminal tagging of orf6 with BirA, separated by a flexible linker (GGGGS). Full protocol for virus recovery using the CLEVER method in (10.7554/eLife.89035). Functionality of BirA in rescued virus not tested.",
